e only stock weapon with the extra-headset block populated:\n$WEAP,1,2,100,0,0,45,0,,,,,,70,80,900,850,6,24,400,2,7,100,100,,0,,,T01,,,,D01,D28,D27,D18,,,,,6,12,75,30,*\n"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button","class":"copy-btn","aria-label":"Copy code"},"copy"]],"\n",["P",{"class":"src"},["SPAN",{},"Source:"]," ",["A",{"href":"https://github.com/tony99nyr/open-brx/blob/main/protocol/brx-protocol.md","rel":"noopener"},"protocol/brx-protocol.md"]," §6; ",["A",{"href":"https://github.com/tony99nyr/open-brx/blob/main/mcp/brx_mcp/__main__.py","rel":"noopener"},"mcp/brx_mcp/__main__.py"]," (captured frames)"]],"\n",["SECTION",{"class":"blk blk-diagram","data-type":"diagram"},["FIGURE",{"class":"fig fig-svg fig-pending","id":"DEV-05","style":"--ratio:16/9"},["DIV",{"class":"ph ph-svg","role":"img","aria-label":"A horizontal token ruler of 43 cells (t0–t42) colour-coded by block: identity (t0–t2), damage/IR (t3–t6), secondary-dormant (t7–t11, hatched grey), extra-headset (t12–t13, t42), cadence & ammo (t14–t19), fire mode/accuracy/burst/overheat (t20–t26), sounds (t27–t36), overheat gate (t37–t38), ammo tail (t39–t41). Each cell shows its index and a short label; t14 and t20 get a \"bench-proven\" badge; t15 gets a \"constant 850 — don't write\" badge."},["SPAN",{"class":"ph-id"},"DEV-05"],["SPAN",{"class":"ph-kind"},"diagram pending"]],["FIGCAPTION",{},"Token ruler t0–t42 colour-coded by block: identity · damage/IR · secondary (dormant) · extra-headset · cadence/ammo · fire mode/overheat · sounds · tail."]],["P",{"class":"src"},["SPAN",{},"Source:"]," table below"]],"\n",["SECTION",{"class":"blk blk-data-table","data-type":"data-table"},["H2",{"id":"token-map-0-indexed-weap-the-slot-is-t0"},"Token map (0-indexed: ",["CODE",{},"$WEAP,<t0>,<t1>,…,*"],"; the slot is t0)"],["DIV",{"class":"dt","data-rows":"39"},["DIV",{"class":"dt-bar"},["INPUT",{"__playwright_value_":"","type":"search","placeholder":"Filter this table…","aria-label":"Filter table"}],["SPAN",{"class":"dt-count","aria-l